{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "82ed3ea4-a94f-8de9-a3c6-816104f62da4",
  "created_at": "2026-03-02T11:36:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Esteban Mejia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:33:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:33:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, good morning. Um, I'm calling about my license. For the food, the victualler. I've got to renew it and I got a paper in the mail, but I don't know if I'm reading it right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:33:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sure. Let's take it slowly. Is this a renewal of an existing victualler license?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:34:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, renewal. I've had it wicked long, I don't know, decades. Is the form different this year? Because last year I filled out the, the blue one, and this one looks, I don't know, longer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:34:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't say for certain what the one in your hand looks like. Forms do get updated from time to time. What does the top of the page say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:34:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on. Let me get my glasses. [pause] It says application for... license year. And then there's a part about the, the inspection. Is that new? I thought the inspection was a different thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:34:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Those can be separate steps. Some of the sign-offs, like health or fire, may come from other offices and then get attached to the renewal. So you may have a couple of pieces to gather."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:34:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. So it's not just the one paper? I thought it was the one paper and a check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:34:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It might be more than that this time. Easiest thing is to bring in the form you received, filled out as best you can, and we'll go through it with you at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:35:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What do I bring, then? In person. Just the form?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:35:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bring the form, your current license, and a photo ID. And bring the notice you got in the mail, since it may list what's needed. If you've got any certificates from the inspections, bring those too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:35:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The current license, the one on the wall? Or a copy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:35:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The original is fine, we can make a copy and hand it right back. No need to take it off the wall until you're coming in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:35:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. Because I don't drive much anymore. My sister in Tiverton is driving down to help me, so I want to get it right the one time and not make her come twice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:35:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. We're open weekdays, so pick a day that works for her. If you're unsure about anything on the form, bring it anyway and we'll sort it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:35:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the form, the license, the ID, and the letter. And the inspection papers, if I got them. Did I say that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:35:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. You've got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:36:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'm still not sure about the inspection part, but I guess I'll find out there. Thank you, Owen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T11:36:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Mejia. Take care."
    }
  ],
